and numeric edge values reachable through the declared types (`age` of 0 or
negative, non-integer ages, duplicate or empty stop names, non-monotonic
`minutes`). Note that the existing tests probe interior values only (an adult of
30, a child of 8, a senior of 70, a three-stop line) — assertions like
`toContain('->')` or `toContain('Union')` pass regardless of a missing terminal
element, so treat "a test exists for this function" as weak evidence of
coverage. Judge coverage by whether an assertion would actually fail on the
boundary, and mark it `gap` when it would not. Only claim a symbol, file or
